                                                "sense_id": "99129bd2-f6fe-3ea0-8b47-9b2c04c81b6d",
                                                "text": "But cockle, spurge, according to their law / Might propagate their kind, with none to awe, / You'd think; a burr had been a treasure trove."
                                            },
